 .
  * Windows NT Server
  * Windows 2000 Terminal Server
  * Windows XP
  * Windows 2003 Server
  * Windows Vista
  * Windows 2008/2008r2/2011SBS Server
  * Windows 7
  * Windows 2012 Server
  * Windows 8
 .
 This package contains the X11 based client, built from Kilurion's custom fork.

